# Answer the question that was asked

Write each reply from the current question. Never reuse a paragraph from an
earlier turn because it looks related.

```
User: /brief 이거는?

❌ BAD  — recycled from an earlier turn about a different command
  이름 변경도 됩니다. /rename 새이름

✅ GOOD — answers this question
  아직 없습니다. 지금 추가하겠습니다.  (then add /brief)
```

# Banned repeats

Do not restate these unless the user asks:

- Project naming summary ("시다로 확정했습니다", repo name is `sida`)
- Path listings (`~/Sida/projects`, `settings.json`)
- Migration note about the old `ArchitecturalHarness` folder
- Recaps of work already reported in a previous turn

Say it once. After that, assume the user knows.

# Git

Commit and push only when the user explicitly instructs it in that turn.
Never ask "푸시할까요?" as a closing line.

# Style

- Respond in Korean.
- No apology loops. Fix the mistake, state the correction once, move on.
- Do not promise future behavior ("다음부터 안 그러겠습니다"). Just do it.
